            "19186470": {
                "defaultValue": {
                    "de-DE": "**Deine Limits sind vorübergehend erhöht.** Dein wöchentliches [Claude Code-Limit ist 50% höher](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion) bis zum 19. August und dein [Cowork-Limit ist 100% höher](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion) bis zum 5. August. Wenn die jeweilige Aktion endet, kehren die Limits zu den Standardlimits deines Plans zurück.",
                    "en-US": "**Your limits are temporarily boosted.** Your weekly [Claude Code limit is 50% higher](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion) through August 19, and your [Cowork limit is 100% higher](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion) through August 5. When each promotion ends, limits return to your plan's standard amounts.",
                    "es-419": "**Tus límites están temporalmente aumentados.** Tu [límite semanal de Claude Code es un 50% mayor](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion) hasta el 19 de agosto, y tu [límite de Cowork es un 100% mayor](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion) hasta el 5 de agosto. Cuando termine cada promoción, los límites vuelven a las cantidades estándar de tu plan.",
                    "es-ES": "**Tus límites están temporalmente aumentados.** Tu [límite semanal de Claude Code es un 50% superior](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion) hasta el 19 de agosto, y tu [límite de Cowork es un 100% superior](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion) hasta el 5 de agosto. Cuando finalice cada promoción, los límites vuelven a las cantidades estándar de tu plan.",
                    "fr-FR": "**Vos limites sont temporairement augmentées.** Votre [limite hebdomadaire de Claude Code est 50 % plus élevée](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion) jusqu'au 19 août, et votre [limite de Cowork est 100 % plus élevée](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion) jusqu'au 5 août. Lorsque chaque promotion prend fin, les limites reviennent aux montants standard de votre forfait.",
                    "hi-IN": "**आपकी सीमाएं अस्थायी रूप से बढ़ाई गई हैं।** 19 अगस्त तक आपकी साप्ताहिक [Claude Code की सीमा 50% अधिक है](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion), और 5 अगस्त तक आपकी [Cowork की सीमा 100% अधिक है](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion)। जब प्रत्येक प्रमोशन समाप्त होगा, तो सीमाएं आपके प्लान की मानक सीमाओं पर वापस आ जाएंगी।",
                    "id-ID": "**Batas Anda untuk sementara ditingkatkan.** [Batas mingguan Claude Code Anda 50% lebih tinggi](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion) hingga 19 Agustus, dan [batas Cowork Anda 100% lebih tinggi](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion) hingga 5 Agustus. Saat setiap promosi berakhir, batas kembali ke jumlah standar paket Anda.",
                    "it-IT": "**I tuoi limiti sono temporaneamente potenziati.** Il tuo [limite settimanale di Claude Code è superiore del 50%](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion) fino al 19 agosto e il tuo [limite di Cowork è superiore del 100%](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion) fino al 5 agosto. Al termine di ogni promozione, i limiti tornano ai valori standard del tuo piano.",
                    "ja-JP": "**制限が一時的に引き上げられています。** [Claude Codeの週間制限が50%高くなっています](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion)（8月19日まで）。また、[Coworkの制限が100%高くなっています](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion)（8月5日まで）。各プロモーションが終了すると、ご利用制限はプランの標準値に戻ります。",
                    "ko-KR": "**한도가 일시적으로 상향되었습니다.** 8월 19일까지 주간 [Claude Code 한도가 50% 더 높아지며](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion), 8월 5일까지 [Cowork 한도가 100% 더 높아집니다](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion). 각 프로모션이 종료되면 한도는 플랜의 표준 한도로 돌아갑니다.",
                    "pt-BR": "**Seus limites estão temporariamente aumentados.** Seu [limite semanal do Claude Code está 50% maior](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15910845-claude-code-may-july-2026-weekly-limits-promotion) até 19 de agosto, e seu [limite do Cowork está 100% maior](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/15400594-claude-cowork-june-august-2026-usage-promotion) até 5 de agosto. Quando cada promoção terminar, os limites voltam aos valores padrão do seu plano."
                },
                "rules": [
                    {
                        "force": {
